        <header><div><span>DIRECT REFERRAL</span><h2>Schedule without an application</h2><p>Enter the candidate directly. The referral is written to Opening_Applied and TPO_Log, then an invitation is sent to the email provided.</p></div><button type="button" onClick={() => !directSaving && setDirectOpen(false)} aria-label="Close"><X size={19} /></button></header>
